  "description" : "For millennia, Immortal Emperor Zhao Yingxiong had cultivated diligently, yet remained stuck at the Immortal Emperor realm, unable to break through the void. Suddenly, the strongest cultivation system, dormant for 80,000 years, went live. Its first task was to slap the buttocks of Zhang San, the chosen one who had humiliated him 80,000 years prior, 89 times. The reward was the key to breaking through to the next realm, \"Primordial Dao Rhyme.\" Zhao Yingxiong returned to the Qingyun Sect, only to find Zhang San now a beautiful, amnesiac sect founder. The sect was in decline, with only three female disciples remaining, and was under siege by the Bloodthirsty Sect. After destroying the Bloodthirsty Sect and completing the task, Zhang San advanced to the Golden Core stage, and Zhao Yingxiong himself obtained the Primordial Dao Rhyme. The system continued to cause trouble: hunting living creatures without explaining the rules, issuing Foundation Establishment experience cards that tricked him into reaching the Foundation Establishment stage, attracting the pursuit of the Blood Abyss and the Heavenly Mystery Elder. Zhao Yingxiong used his Immortal Emperor wisdom to deceive his disciples and buy time, waiting for the divine beast to return and restore his strength to defeat the Heavenly Mystery Elder, annex the Primordial Immortal Mansion and the Heavenly Sword Holy Land, and transform the Qingyun Sect into the Qingyun Immortal Sect. As the primordial Daoist energy increased, he discovered that his rebirth, the system`s delay, and the sect`s decline all stemmed from the 80,000-year-old Heavenly Dao chess game, and the game had only just begun.\nsource: movie.douban.com/googletranslate",
